			<zone xml:id="p2z27-0" points="1338,2001 1409,1977 1451,2005 1558,1973 1652,1977 1675,2001 1753,2010 1835,1994 1835,1895 1778,1886 1718,1907 1636,1874 1458,1877 1427,1895 1338,1879">1351,1960 1376,1958 1402,1957 1428,1957 1453,1957 1479,1957 1505,1955 1531,1954 1556,1954 1582,1955 1608,1956 1634,1957 1659,1957 1685,1955 1711,1954 1737,1954 1762,1954 1788,1954 1814,1953 1840,1951</zone>
